  "descriptionHtml": "<h3>Soon the boat is on land again – and the motor sits unprotected until spring</h3><p>Rain, snow and frost work away at the outboard for six months. And a bare motor on a boat in storage is the first thing a thief spots from the road.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1013/0322/2621/files/batmotorskydd-vinter-tackt.jpg?v=1787317562\" alt=\"The motor cover on a boat in storage on a trailer – winter storage\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px\"></p><h3>A full winter cover for the outboard</h3><p>Pull the cover over the whole motor – from the cowl down over the leg – and tighten the strap around the middle. 420D Oxford fabric keeps weather and dirt out for the whole storage period, and a covered motor is a much duller prize than an open one.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1013/0322/2621/files/batmotor-pa-bat.jpg?v=1787331844\" alt=\"The cover on an outboard motor at the storage spot\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"></p><h3>Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>The motor winters under cover</strong> – covers from cowl to leg, not just the top</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Lasts a whole winter outside</strong> – hard-wearing 420D Oxford fabric against rain, snow and UV</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Less tempting to thieves</strong> – no one can see which motor is underneath</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fits your motor</strong> – nine sizes from 0–5 hp to 250–350 hp, see the size guide</li>\n<li>\n<strong>On before the boat is even strapped down</strong> – pulled over and tightened, no tools</li>\n</ul><h3>Size guide – outboard motor cover</h3><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;max-width:480px\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">Motor</th><th style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">Circumference</th><th style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">Height</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">6–15 hp</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">140 cm</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">115 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">15–20 hp</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">150 cm</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">130 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">20–30 hp</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">165 cm</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">142 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">30–60 hp</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">180 cm</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">149 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">60–100 hp</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">200 cm</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">175 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">100–150 hp</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">226 cm</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">195 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">175–225 hp</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">248 cm</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left\">200 cm</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555\">Circumference is measured around the motor cowl. Measurements are approximate and may vary slightly.</p><h3>Change of mind</h3><p>You have 14 days to change your mind, counted from the day you receive the item.</p>"
